{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/MISOTokensSemantic\/documentation\/MISOTokensSemantic\/MultipleColorSemanticToken"},"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MultipleColorSemanticToken","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"c:@M@MISOTokensSemantic@objc(cs)MultipleColorSemanticToken","modules":[{"name":"Tokens for semantics"}],"title":"MultipleColorSemanticToken","roleHeading":"Class","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"class","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MultipleColorSemanticToken"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"final","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MultipleColorSemanticToken","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["        \/\/ Assuming in Figma with have a color semantic token bgPrimary,","        \/\/ two semantic color tokens will be defined in Figma and generated by tokenator.","        \/\/ They can be declared in protocol ColorSemanticTokens,","        \/\/ and defined automaticaly in MISOTheme+ColorSemanticTokens extension","        var bgPrimaryLight: ColorSemanticToken { ColorRawTokens.functionalWhite }","        var bgPrimaryDark: ColorSemanticToken { ColorRawTokens.functionalDarkGray880 }","","        \/\/ Then the develoment team declares an \"higher\" level color semantic token for bgPrimary","        \/\/ inside ColorMultipleSemanticTokens protocol,","        \/\/ and defined inside MISOTheme+ColorMultipleSemanticToken extension","        var bgPrimary: MultipleColorSemanticToken { MultipleColorSemanticToken(light: bgPrimaryLight, dark: bgPrimaryDark) }","","        \/\/ If the same color is used whatever the color scheme is","        var bgPrimary: MultipleColorSemanticToken { MultipleColorSemanticToken(bgPrimaryLight) }","","        \/\/ The theme exposes both generated color semantic tokens and \"crafted\" higher level color semantic tokens.","        \/\/ It is recommended to use the higher level version as it is less error-prone."]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["     @Environment(\\.theme) var theme","     @Environment(\\.colorScheme) var colorScheme","","    \/\/ Given you want to apply the color token \"surfaceBrandPrimary\"","    var body: some View {","        \/\/ Apply the token of color for the view without managing yourself the color scheme","        SomeView()","            .background(theme.colors.surfaceBrandPrimary)","","        \/\/ Or also foregroundStyle(), foregroundColor(), accentColor(), ...","    }"]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ Or get the token depending to the color scheme and do whatever you want with","    theme.colors.surfaceBrandPrimary.color(for: colorScheme)"]},{"style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS 0.8.0"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Since"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOTokensSemantic\/documentation\/MISOTokensSemantic"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/misotokenssemantic\/multiplecolorsemantictoken"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Kind of semantic tokens which will wrap a combination of "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOTokensSemantic\/documentation\/MISOTokensSemantic\/ColorSemanticToken","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" depending to ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"color scheme"}]},{"text":" (i.e. ligh mode or dark mode).","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Kind of composite token with multiple values, but not named “composite” because this word is already used in the design system.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Allows to gather the multiple-value tokens from ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Figma"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" inside one object.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"If a color token exists with its value depending to the color scheme, it must be packed in such ``MultipleColorSemanticToken`","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOTokensSemantic\/documentation\/MISOTokensSemantic\/MultipleColorSemanticToken\/init(_:)","doc:\/\/MISOTokensSemantic\/documentation\/MISOTokensSemantic\/MultipleColorSemanticToken\/init(light:dark:)"],"anchor":"Initializers"},{"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOTokensSemantic\/documentation\/MISOTokensSemantic\/MultipleColorSemanticToken\/dark","doc:\/\/MISOTokensSemantic\/documentation\/MISOTokensSemantic\/MultipleColorSemanticToken\/light"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"title":"Instance Methods","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOTokensSemantic\/documentation\/MISOTokensSemantic\/MultipleColorSemanticToken\/color(for:)","doc:\/\/MISOTokensSemantic\/documentation\/MISOTokensSemantic\/MultipleColorSemanticToken\/hasForbiddenColorValue()","doc:\/\/MISOTokensSemantic\/documentation\/MISOTokensSemantic\/MultipleColorSemanticToken\/isEqual(_:)"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods"}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOTokensSemantic\/objc(cs)NSObject"],"type":"inheritsFrom","kind":"relationships","title":"Inherits From"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOTokensSemantic\/objc(pl)NSObject","doc:\/\/MISOTokensSemantic\/s7CVarArgP","doc:\/\/MISOTokensSemantic\/s28CustomDebugStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/MISOTokensSemantic\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/MISOTokensSemantic\/SQ","doc:\/\/MISOTokensSemantic\/SH","doc:\/\/MISOTokensSemantic\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/MISOTokensSemantic\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conforms